  "title": "Grilled Lamb Shoulder Chops with Fresh Mint Jelly",
  "description": "This lamb shoulder chop recipe from Chef John marinades the lamb in pomegranate juice with garlic and rosemary, and serves the chops with homemade mint jelly.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-07-12T00:11:47-04:00",
